{"seq":3,"slug":"labeler-retention-quality","title":"标注员留存与质量挂钩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relevance-crowdsourcing-label/labeler-management/labeler-retention-quality","wordCount":2858,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"标注员留存与质量挂钩\">标注员留存与质量挂钩</h1><p>一个标注员从注册到成为熟练工，平台在他身上投入了准入考试、培训、保护期配额和画像收敛的全部成本。如果他在第三周流失，这些投入就被一次性地冲销了；而众包的自然流失率往往高得惊人，一个人今天在标，明天可能就不来了，没有任何离职流程通知平台。更棘手的是流失往往是<strong>选择性的</strong>——走掉的倾向于那些质量最好、最认真的人，因为他们更容易在别处找到更好的报酬。留下来的如果主要是「别处不要」的那部分人，平台的质量就会在人员总量的稳定中缓慢下滑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-留存要分群-不能用总体流失率\">核心概念：留存要分群，不能用总体流失率</h2><h3 id=\"三个分群轴\">三个分群轴</h3><p>平台报表上最常见的数字是整体流失率，而这个数字几乎没有行动价值，因为它掩盖了人群之间的巨大差异。有意义的分群至少有三个轴。</p>\n<p>按<strong>质量等级</strong>分群，回答的是「优秀的人有没有被留住」。这是最重要的一群，因为他们的流失对数据集质量的边际伤害最大。按<strong>熟练度阶段</strong>分群，回答的是「新人有没有熬过保护期」。新人的流失集中在最初两周，原因通常与质量无关（收入低、界面难用、任务量不足），因此处置手段也不同。按<strong>活跃模式</strong>分群，回答的是「兼职与全职谁是主力」。两者的产能曲线与对价格的敏感度完全不同，混在一起看会得到自相矛盾的结论。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[注册] --&gt; B[准入考试]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C[保护期&lt;br/&gt;高抽检 高保障]&#10;  B --&gt;|未通过| Z[退出]&#10;  C --&gt;|画像收敛| D[常规期]&#10;  D --&gt;|质量升 等级升| E[骨干群&lt;br/&gt;低抽检 高单价]&#10;  D --&gt;|质量降| F[观察期]&#10;  F --&gt;|持续下降| G[降级或终止]&#10;  F --&gt;|恢复| D&#10;  E --&gt;|长期不活跃| H[沉睡]&#10;  H --&gt;|召回活动| D&#10;  D --&gt;|自然流失| Z\">graph TD\n  A[注册] --&gt; B[准入考试]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C[保护期&lt;br/&gt;高抽检 高保障]\n  B --&gt;|未通过| Z[退出]\n  C --&gt;|画像收敛| D[常规期]\n  D --&gt;|质量升 等级升| E[骨干群&lt;br/&gt;低抽检 高单价]\n  D --&gt;|质量降| F[观察期]\n  F --&gt;|持续下降| G[降级或终止]\n  F --&gt;|恢复| D\n  E --&gt;|长期不活跃| H[沉睡]\n  H --&gt;|召回活动| D\n  D --&gt;|自然流失| Z</pre><p>图中「沉睡」与「退出」是两个不同的状态，这个区分很重要：沉睡指一段时间未登录但账号仍然有效。众包场景下有相当比例的人会在一段时间后回来，把沉睡当作流失会让召回策略无从下手，也会高估流失率并导致过度扩张招募。</p>\n<p>三个分群轴与生命周期状态是正交的：同一个人可能处在常规期、属于兼职群、但质量等级很高。因此流失率的正确算法是先分群再算率，而不是先算率再想办法拆开——后者在数据上做不到，因为分子和分母的构成已经混在一起了。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分群轴</th>\n<th>分群取值</th>\n<th>该群流失的真正原因</th>\n<th>对应的处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>质量等级</td>\n<td>高 / 中 / 低</td>\n<td>报酬竞争力、任务趣味性</td>\n<td>任务优先权、单价联动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>熟练阶段</td>\n<td>保护期 / 常规期 / 骨干期</td>\n<td>收入低、任务量不足、界面难用</td>\n<td>保护价、定向配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活跃模式</td>\n<td>全职 / 兼职 / 间歇</td>\n<td>与主业的时间冲突、季节因素</td>\n<td>定向召回、弹性任务量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"质量分-一个能被刷上去的指标就是坏指标\">质量分：一个能被刷上去的指标就是坏指标</h2><h3 id=\"多信号复合的必要性\">多信号复合的必要性</h3><p>质量挂钩留存的前提是有一个可信的质量分，而设计质量分时的第一原则是：<strong>假设每个参与者的行为是有策略的</strong>。任何单一信号都可以被针对性优化。以金标题正确率作为唯一指标，会诱发标注员识别金标题的模式（例如某些查询反复出现、某些文档明显是测试用）并只在这些任务上认真；以抽检正确率作为唯一指标，会诱发「在被抽检时表现好」的行为，而抽检是可被感知的（见 <a href=\"../quality-arbitration/gold-question-spotcheck\">金标题/抽检质检</a>）；以标注速度作为正项，会诱发赶工。</p>\n<p>对抗策略性行为的标准做法是<strong>多信号复合</strong>，让不同信号指向不同的作弊成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>gold</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>spot</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>arb</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>gold</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>spot</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>arb</mtext></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_j = 1 - \\left(\\frac{E_j^{\\text{gold}} + E_j^{\\text{spot}} + \\lambda \\cdot E_j^{\\text{arb}}}{N_j^{\\text{gold}} + N_j^{\\text{spot}} + \\lambda \\cdot N_j^{\\text{arb}}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.04em;vertical-align:-1.27em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.77em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.143em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gold</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">spot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8309em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">arb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.803em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gold</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">spot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">arb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3948em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.27em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 分别是各类质检中的错误数与样本数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 给仲裁样本更高的权重（因为仲裁是成本最高的判定，可信度也最高）。这个式子的输出是错误率的估计，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 减去它得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是质量分。注意它把三类样本合并成一个比率而不是分别打分再加权平均——合并的好处是分母自动按真实样本量加权，样本多的来源自然占更大权重，避免「金标题做了 5 条全对」和「仲裁 200 条对了 180 条」被赋予相同的重要性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复合公式的实现\">复合公式的实现</h3><p>这个式子落成 SQL 是一条分组聚合，关键在于三类来源的样本数与错误数从不同的表里取，最后在同一个分母上合并。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 的作用是让仲裁样本在分母里按倍数计入，而不是单独算一个分再加权。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT labeler_id,&#10;       1 - (&#10;         coalesce(sum(errors_gold), 0)&#10;       + coalesce(sum(errors_spot), 0)&#10;       + $1 * coalesce(sum(errors_arb), 0)&#10;       )::numeric&#10;       / greatest(&#10;         coalesce(sum(n_gold), 0)&#10;       + coalesce(sum(n_spot), 0)&#10;       + $1 * coalesce(sum(n_arb), 0), 1) AS q_raw&#10;FROM (&#10;  SELECT labeler_id,&#10;         count(*) FILTER (WHERE NOT correct) AS errors_gold,&#10;         count(*)                           AS n_gold,&#10;         0 AS errors_spot, 0 AS n_spot, 0 AS errors_arb, 0 AS n_arb&#10;  FROM gold_samples  GROUP BY labeler_id&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT labeler_id,&#10;         0, 0,&#10;         count(*) FILTER (WHERE NOT correct), count(*),&#10;         0, 0&#10;  FROM spot_samples  GROUP BY labeler_id&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT labeler_id,&#10;         0, 0, 0, 0,&#10;         count(*) FILTER (WHERE overturned), count(*)&#10;  FROM arb_samples   GROUP BY labeler_id&#10;) u&#10;GROUP BY labeler_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labeler_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(errors_gold), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(errors_spot), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(errors_arb), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       )::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> greatest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_gold), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_spot), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_arb), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q_raw</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labeler_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> correct) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> errors_gold,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_gold,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> errors_spot, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_spot, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> errors_arb, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_arb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gold_samples  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labeler_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labeler_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> correct), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spot_samples  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labeler_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labeler_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> overturned), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E